# Day 9 - NutriScope: AI-Powered Nutrition Intelligence Dashboard

## Overview

Today I designed and explored a nutrition analytics application called **NutriScope**.

The objective was to combine nutrition tracking, data analytics, visualization, and personalized recommendations into a modern dashboard experience.

NutriScope helps users understand their daily nutrition intake, identify nutrient deficiencies, and make informed dietary decisions.

---

## Project Objective

Build a nutrition intelligence platform that can:

* Track daily food consumption
* Calculate macro and micronutrient intake
* Monitor nutrition goals
* Detect deficiencies and excesses
* Generate personalized recommendations
* Provide an interactive dashboard experience

---

